WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.090
New haircut. You want
to tell a French friend:

2
00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:04.590
I had my hair cut.

3
00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:07.230
You know «les cheveux», hair.

4
00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:09.640
You know «couper», to cut.

5
00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:10.910
But say it the wrong way,

6
00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:12.910
and your friend pictures
you in the bathroom,

7
00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:14.550
scissors in hand.

8
00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:16.220
English says had.

9
00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:18.730
So does French just use «avoir»?

10
00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:20.530
How do you say someone else did it,

11
00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:22.800
in French that sounds French?

12
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:26.260
In this mission, you'll sort
sentences into two lanes:

13
00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:28.240
one object or two.

14
00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:32.560
Then you'll move pronoun chips in
the lab until every sentence clicks.

15
00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:35.090
Your mission: work out
how to get a haircut

16
00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:38.270
in French without lying
about who held the scissors.
